#
msgid ""
msgstr "Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"

msgid "Add Rule"
msgstr "Dodaj pravilo"

msgid ""
"Add rules to define which profile and entity the user will receive based on "
"their email domain (Optional)."
msgstr ""
"Dodajte pravila za določitev profila in entitete, ki ju uporabnik dobi na "
"podlagi e-poštne domene (Neobvezno)."

msgid "Automatically create users on first login"
msgstr "Samodejno ustvari uporabnike ob prvi prijavi"

msgid "Configuration updated."
msgstr "Konfiguracija posodobljena."

msgid "Default Rule (Fallback)"
msgstr "Privzeto pravilo (Zaledno)"

msgid "Default entity (ELSE)"
msgstr "Privzeta entiteta (DRUGAČE)"

msgid "Default profile (ELSE)"
msgstr "Privzeti profil (DRUGAČE)"

msgid "Domain (after @)"
msgstr "Domena (za @)"

msgid "Entity"
msgstr "Entiteta"

msgid "Failed to create the user in GLPI."
msgstr "Ustvarjanje uporabnika v GLPI ni uspelo."

msgid "Google SSO"
msgstr "Google SSO"

msgid "Google SSO — Configuration"
msgstr "Google SSO — Konfiguracija"

msgid "Google authentication failed: %s"
msgstr "Googlova avtentikacija ni uspela: %s"

msgid "Google login cancelled: %s"
msgstr "Prijava z Googlom preklicana: %s"

msgid "Google response without authorization code."
msgstr "Googlov odgovor brez kode za avtorizacijo."

msgid ""
"If the user email does not match any of the rules above, this profile and "
"entity will be used. Mandatory if automatic creation is enabled."
msgstr ""
"Če se uporabnikov e-poštni naslov ne ujema z nobenim od zgornjih pravil, se "
"uporabita ta profil in entiteta. Obvezno, če je omogočeno samodejno "
"ustvarjanje."

msgid "Invalid OAuth2 state. Try again from the login page."
msgstr "Neveljavno stanje OAuth2. Poskusite znova na strani za prijavo."

msgid "Leave blank to keep current secret (stored encrypted)."
msgstr ""
"Pustite prazno, če želite obdržati trenutno skrivnost (shranjeno šifrirano)."

msgid "No GLPI user corresponds to this Google account."
msgstr "Noben uporabnik GLPI ne ustreza temu Google računu."

msgid "Only accounts from the %s domain are accepted."
msgstr "Sprejemamo samo račune z domene %s."

msgid "Profile"
msgstr "Profil"

msgid "Profile and Entity Rules by Domain"
msgstr "Pravila za Profil in Entiteto glede na Domeno"

msgid "Register this Redirect URI in Google Cloud Console:"
msgstr "Registrirajte ta preusmeritveni URI v Google Cloud Console:"

msgid "Restrict to domain (optional)"
msgstr "Omejitev na domeno (neobvezno)"

msgid "Save"
msgstr "Shrani"

msgid "Select..."
msgstr "Izberi..."

msgid "Session not initialized: user has no enabled profile."
msgstr "Seja ni inicializirana: uporabnik nima omogočenega profila."

msgid "Sign in with Google"
msgstr "Prijavite se z Googlom"

msgid "The Google account does not have a verified email."
msgstr "Google račun nima preverjenega e-poštnega naslova."

msgid "This user is deactivated in GLPI."
msgstr "Ta uporabnik je deaktiviran v GLPI."

msgid "or"
msgstr "ali"

msgid ""
"Leave the option <strong>\"Remove domain of logins in form "
"login@domain\"</strong> as <strong>No</strong>. If enabled, users with the "
"same prefix in different providers (e.g., admin@gmail.com and "
"admin@institution.edu.br) will suffer account overlap."
msgstr ""
"Pustite možnost <strong>»Odstrani domeno prijav v obliki "
"prijava@domena«</strong> kot <strong>Ne</strong>. Če je omogočeno, bodo "
"uporabniki z isto predpono pri različnih ponudnikih (npr. admin@gmail.com in"
" admin@institution.edu.br) utrpeli prekrivanje računov."

msgid ""
"Check the <strong>Activate \"Sign in with Google\" button</strong> option "
"below and click <strong>Save</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Preverite možnost <strong>Aktiviraj gumb »Prijava z Googlom«</strong> spodaj"
" in kliknite <strong>Shrani</strong>."

msgid ""
"Change the <strong>Automatically add users from an external authentication "
"source</strong> field to <strong>Yes</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Spremenite polje <strong>Samodejno dodaj uporabnike iz zunanjega vira "
"preverjanja pristnosti</strong> na <strong>Da</strong>."

msgid "Step 1: Google Cloud Preparation"
msgstr "1. korak: Priprava na Google Cloud"

msgid "Critical Warning:"
msgstr "Kritično opozorilo:"

msgid "How to enable Google SSO integration?"
msgstr "Kako omogočiti integracijo Google SSO?"

msgid ""
"Google will generate a <strong>Client ID</strong> and a <strong>Client "
"Secret</strong>. Fill in the fields in this form with those keys."
msgstr ""
"Google bo ustvaril <strong>ID odjemalca</strong> in <strong>Skrivnost "
"odjemalca</strong>. Izpolnite polja v tem obrazcu s temi ključi."

msgid ""
"Access the <a href=\"https://console.cloud.google.com/\" "
"target=\"_blank\">Google Cloud Console</a> and create a new "
"<strong>Project</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Dostopite do <a href=\"https://console.cloud.google.com/\" "
"target=\"_blank\">Google Cloud Console</a> in ustvarite nov "
"<strong>Projekt</strong>."

msgid "Redirect URI:"
msgstr "URI preusmeritve:"

msgid "Activate \"Sign in with Google\" button"
msgstr "Aktivirajte gumb »Prijava z Googlom«."

msgid ""
"Then go to <strong>Credentials &gt; Create Credentials &gt; OAuth client "
"ID</strong>, choosing the <strong>Web application</strong> type."
msgstr ""
"Nato pojdite na <strong>Poverilnice &gt; Ustvari poverilnice &gt; ID "
"odjemalca OAuth</strong>, izbira vrste <strong>Spletne aplikacije</strong>."

msgid "Step 2: GLPI Authentication Preparation"
msgstr "2. korak: Priprava avtentikacije GLPI"

msgid ""
"Go to <strong>APIs &amp; Services &gt; OAuth consent screen</strong> and "
"configure your app (add the scopes <code>email</code>, <code>profile</code>,"
" and <code>openid</code>)."
msgstr ""
"Pojdite na <strong>API-ji &amp; Storitve &gt; Zaslon za soglasje "
"OAuth</strong> in konfigurirajte svojo aplikacijo (dodajte obsege "
"<code>email</code>, <code>profile</code> in <code>openid</code>)."

msgid "In GLPI, go to <strong>Setup &gt; Authentication &gt; Setup</strong>."
msgstr ""
"V GLPI pojdite na <strong>Nastavitev &gt; Preverjanje pristnosti &gt; "
"Nastavitev</strong>."

msgid ""
"Under <strong>Authorized redirect URIs</strong>, copy and paste exactly the "
"return URL below:"
msgstr ""
"Pod <strong>Pooblaščeni preusmeritveni URI-ji</strong> kopirajte in "
"prilepite natanko spodnji povratni URL:"

msgid ""
"Subdomains are also accepted. E.g.: \"company.com\" will allow "
"user@company.com and user@sub.company.com."
msgstr ""
"Sprejete so tudi poddomene. Npr.: \"company.com\" bo dovolil "
"user@company.com in user@sub.company.com."

msgid ""
"To test the account creation rules and discover which Profile/Entity will be"
" assigned to an email,"
msgstr ""
"Če želite preizkusiti pravila za ustvarjanje računa in ugotoviti, kateri "
"profil/entiteta bo dodeljena e-pošti,"

msgid ""
"The plugin calls <code>Session::init()</code>. The GLPI core loads the "
"user\\'s profiles and starts the session. The user is redirected to the "
"dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Vtičnik pokliče <code>Session::init()</code>. Jedro GLPI naloži uporabnikove"
" profile in začne sejo. Uporabnik je preusmerjen na nadzorno ploščo."

msgid "Error Creating Account"
msgstr "Napaka pri ustvarjanju računa"

msgid "No Profile Configured"
msgstr "Noben profil ni konfiguriran"

msgid "Database Search"
msgstr "Iskanje po bazi podatkov"

msgid "Do you wish to proceed and create your account now?"
msgstr "Ali želite nadaljevati in ustvariti svoj račun zdaj?"

msgid "click here"
msgstr "kliknite tukaj"

msgid "Auto Creation Disabled"
msgstr "Samodejno ustvarjanje onemogočeno"

msgid "Rules Simulator"
msgstr "Simulator pravil"

msgid ""
"The system would log into the existing account <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d)."
" No new account would be created."
msgstr ""
"Sistem bi se prijavil v obstoječi račun <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d). Nov "
"račun ne bi bil ustvarjen."

msgid "▶️ Simulate Login"
msgstr "▶️ Simulacija prijave"

msgid ""
"Extracted domain: <strong>@%s</strong>. Applied rule: <strong>%s</strong>"
msgstr ""
"Ekstrahirana domena: <strong>@%s</strong>. Uporabljeno pravilo: "
"<strong>%s</strong>"

msgid "Configuration Read"
msgstr "Preberite konfiguracijo"

msgid "User \"%s\" already exists. Login would be performed successfully."
msgstr "Uporabnik \"%s\" že obstaja. Prijava bi bila uspešno izvedena."

msgid ""
"The email domain \"<strong>%s</strong>\" is not allowed. The plugin "
"restricts access to the domain \"<strong>%s</strong>\" or its subdomains."
msgstr ""
"E-poštna domena »<strong>%s</strong>« ni dovoljena. Vtičnik omejuje dostop "
"do domene »<strong>%s</strong>« ali njenih poddomen."

msgid ""
"The plugin calls <code>User::add()</code> to create the user "
"\"<strong>%s</strong>\"."
msgstr ""
"Vtičnik pokliče <code>User::add()</code>, da ustvari uporabnika "
"»<strong>%s</strong>«."

msgid "using the primary email:"
msgstr "z uporabo primarnega e-poštnega naslova:"

msgid "User::add() called"
msgstr "Uporabnik::add() je poklican"

msgid "Profile Determined by Plugin"
msgstr "Profil, ki ga določa vtičnik"

msgid ""
"Profile: <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d) | Entity: <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d)"
msgstr ""
"Profil: <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d) | Subjekt: <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d)"

msgid ""
"The email domain \"<strong>%s</strong>\" is allowed by the restriction rule."
msgstr "E-poštno domeno »<strong>%s</strong>« dovoljuje pravilo omejitve."

msgid "Core Default Profile Assigned"
msgstr "Osnovni privzeti profil je dodeljen"

msgid "Verified email present: <strong>%s</strong>"
msgstr "Preverjeni e-poštni naslov je prisoten: <strong>%s</strong>"

msgid "The user \"%s\" DOES NOT exist and auto-creation is disabled."
msgstr "Uporabnik »%s« NE obstaja in samodejno ustvarjanje je onemogočeno."

msgid "Profile Correction by Plugin"
msgstr "Popravek profila z vtičnikom"

msgid "Yes"
msgstr "ja"

msgid "To access the system via Google, a new account will be created for"
msgstr "Za dostop do sistema prek Googla bo ustvarjen nov račun za"

msgid "Rule Used"
msgstr "Uporabljeno pravilo"

msgid "Plugin googlesso step"
msgstr "Korak vtičnika googlesso"

msgid "Simulator:"
msgstr "Simulator:"

msgid "Account Creation Required"
msgstr "Potrebno je ustvariti račun"

msgid "Domain Rule for \"%s\""
msgstr "Pravilo domene za \"%s\""

msgid ""
"This simulator faithfully reproduces the entire execution chain — from the "
"plugin logic to the internal GLPI Core behavior. Enter an email and see "
"step-by-step what would happen in a real login."
msgstr ""
"Ta simulator zvesto reproducira celotno izvedbeno verigo — od logike "
"vtičnika do notranjega vedenja jedra GLPI. Vnesite e-poštni naslov in po "
"korakih si oglejte, kaj bi se zgodilo ob resnični prijavi."

msgid "Back to configuration"
msgstr "Nazaj na konfiguracijo"

msgid "Account Creation Confirmation"
msgstr "Potrditev ustvarjanja računa"

msgid "Domain Rules"
msgstr "Pravila domene"

msgid "Account Creation Simulator"
msgstr "Simulator za ustvarjanje računa"

msgid "No"
msgstr "št"

msgid "No user found with the email <strong>%s</strong>"
msgstr "Ni uporabnika z e-poštnim naslovom <strong>%s</strong>"

msgid "Login / Email"
msgstr "Prijava / E-pošta"

msgid ""
"The \"Automatically create users\" configuration is "
"<strong>DISABLED</strong>. The login would be blocked."
msgstr ""
"Konfiguracija »Samodejno ustvarjanje uporabnikov« je "
"<strong>ONEMOGOČENA</strong>. Prijava bi bila blokirana."

msgid "(none)"
msgstr "(brez)"

msgid "Login blocked: Only accounts from the %s domain are accepted."
msgstr "Prijava blokirana: Sprejeti so samo računi iz domene %s."

msgid "The user \"%s\" would be created successfully."
msgstr "Uporabnik \"%s\" bi bil uspešno ustvarjen."

msgid ""
"The plugin removes the incorrect profiles assigned by GLPI and explicitly "
"links the profile <strong>%s</strong> and entity <strong>%s</strong> using "
"the <code>Profile_User</code> class."
msgstr ""
"Vtičnik odstrani nepravilne profile, ki jih dodeli GLPI, in izrecno poveže "
"profil <strong>%s</strong> in entiteto <strong>%s</strong> z uporabo razreda"
" <code>Profile_User</code>."

msgid "Email Validation"
msgstr "Preverjanje elektronske pošte"

msgid "User found by email: <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d)"
msgstr "Uporabnik najden po e-pošti: <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d)"

msgid "Domain Restriction Check"
msgstr "Preverjanje omejitve domene"

msgid "None"
msgstr "Noben"

msgid "Session::init() — Login Performed"
msgstr "Session::init() — Prijava izvedena"

msgid "Execution Chain (Step-by-Step)"
msgstr "Veriga izvajanja (korak za korakom)"

msgid "Login to Existing Account"
msgstr "Prijavite se v obstoječi račun"

msgid "How it works:"
msgstr "Kako deluje:"

msgid ""
"In GLPI 11, the core ignores the profile passed by external authentications "
"and automatically assigns the global default profile (usually Self-Service) "
"to the new user."
msgstr ""
"V GLPI 11 jedro ignorira profil, ki ga posredujejo zunanje avtentikacije, in"
" novemu uporabniku samodejno dodeli globalni privzeti profil (običajno "
"samopostrežni)."

msgid "Final Entity"
msgstr "Končna entiteta"

msgid "Final Result"
msgstr "Končni rezultat"

msgid "Back to Login"
msgstr "Nazaj na prijavo"

msgid "Simulated Email:"
msgstr "Simulirana e-pošta:"

msgid ""
"Restrict domain: <strong>%s</strong> | Auto create users: "
"<strong>%s</strong>"
msgstr ""
"Omejite domeno: <strong>%s</strong> | Samodejno ustvari uporabnike: "
"<strong>%s</strong>"

msgid "Final Profile"
msgstr "Končni profil"

msgid ""
"The user \"%s\" would be created, but without ANY profile. Access to GLPI "
"would be denied. Please configure a valid profile in the Default Rule or "
"Domain Rules."
msgstr ""
"Uporabnik \"%s\" bi bil ustvarjen, vendar brez KAKRŠNEGA koli profila. "
"Dostop do GLPI bi bil zavrnjen. Konfigurirajte veljaven profil v privzetem "
"pravilu ali pravilih domene."

msgid "GLPI Core step"
msgstr "Osnovni korak GLPI"

msgid ""
"No valid profile (ID > 0) was found in the plugin rules. The user would be "
"created WITHOUT a profile."
msgstr ""
"V pravilih vtičnika ni bil najden veljaven profil (ID > 0). Uporabnik bi bil"
" ustvarjen BREZ profila."
